    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small game that tests players' quick reaction ability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game graphics are fresh and bright. Players need to use the space bar to control the ball's jump and avoid various obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are unfortunate enough to touch an obstacle, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball moves very fast, so players' reaction speed must keep up with its pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is cleverly designed. Every jump and collision with an obstacle greatly enhances the tension and immersive feeling of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that not only tests reaction ability but also is full of fun, and it is suitable for players of all age groups to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will manipulate a ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball will automatically move forward quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can only control the ball's jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to control the ball to jump over obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ball fails to jump over the obstacle, the game will end in failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game operation method</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump = SPACE </p>",
